<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HBO &amp; Co raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HBO &amp; Co raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter Reynolds analyst Marie Rossi said she upgraded HBO &amp; Co to buy from accumulate based on valuation.</p>
<p>-- said HBO's fundamentals remain strong.</p>
<p>-- HBO gained 3-7/8 to 47-1/2 and was one of the most active Nasdaq issues at midday.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
